# Local env overrides — inside Docker we use docker-compose `environment:`
# instead. If `.env.local` ends up in the image it pins NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL
# to localhost:8000, which inside the frontend container resolves to the
# frontend itself and breaks the /api proxy to the backend.
